Changes of the Raku package "Math::Regressionizer"

0.0.3 2026-10-28
    - Extended the signature of method quantile-regression.
    - Method plot can take specifications for plotting data as scatter points, as line, or as a line with points

0.0.2 2026-10-28
    - Using default Chebyshev-T polynomials basis if the first argument of method quantile-regression-fit is an integer

0.0.1 2026-10-27
    - First version